  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What Core 1 does",
      "items": [
        "Takes the audio frame, paints one configured show, then sends the LEDs",
        "It can drop a frame. It does not block the audio core"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Build differences",
      "items": [
        "k1_hardware does not compile the effect framework. Edge mix is Main RPL and STM only",
        "P4 has its own emitter. WS2816 pack is a Main RPL build, not the default show"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not this plate",
      "items": [
        "Sweet-spot lamps are on the audio side. Traces and motion-lab builds are not production",
        "Drop-cut, attack snap, and chord hue sit inside the show. An authored source can freeze the spectrum"
      ]
    }
  ]
